  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping study protected horticulture in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to identify best practices and innovative solutions for the sustainable development of fully controlled production methods of vegetables and Indoor Farming in Nigeria and to trigger Dutch and Nigerian partners for the development and introduction of new technologies in the Nigerian high-value food chains, with focus on Lagos city. The main goal is to contribute to food security and nutrition, promote Dutch and Nigerian investments and stimulate job creation and entrepreneurship, especially for urban youth.</narrative>
  </description>
